[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0010","text":"（咦，在那里的是……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0020","text":"……那个啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0030","text":"这次，要和事务所的大家一起\n办一场演唱会……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0040","text":"……\n得好好练习才行……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0050","text":"喂──，真乃\n辛苦了────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0060","text":"……辛苦了，制作人。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0070","text":"啊，不，你在跟鸽子们待在一起啊\n打扰到你了，抱歉……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0080","text":"不、不会……！\n完全没关系……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0090","text":"……而且────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20101000_01_0100","text":"……鸽子们\n也飞得很惬意的样子……"}]
